Hi Julio,

I am just a user of this package not developer so take anything I say with a grain of salt!

You could run DAPC analysis on your databset and then use:
 loadingplot(tail(dapc1$var.contr[,1],100), thres=1e-3) to extract the relevant SNPs that explain variation between your treatments. There is more information on this in the adegenet tutorial (look for the "genomic" tutorial as that is geared towards genlight object databsets).

hope that helps,
Kate

